"program_narrative": "PORTUPDT is a batch program that applies maintenance transactions to existing portfolio master records. It opens the indexed portfolio master file (PORTFOLIO-FILE, random access by PORT-KEY) for update and the sequential UPDATE-FILE for reading. The main loop reads one update transaction at a time until end of file. For each transaction it uses the transaction key (portfolio ID and account number) to read the matching portfolio master record; when the record is found it applies the change selected by the action code - 'S' replaces the portfolio status, 'N' replaces the client name and 'V' replaces the total portfolio value (converted through a numeric work field) - and rewrites the record. Transactions whose master record is not found, and rewrites that fail, are counted as errors and displayed. At the end it closes both files, displays the update and error counts, and passes WS-RETURN-CODE to the operating system (0 normally, 8 when a file could not be opened).",
